Subject: [PATCH 41/42] drm/bridge: jh7110-inno-hdmi: Enable HDMI audio

On the JH7110 the HDMI controller's I2S input is driven by the I2S TX0
controller (its bit clock is the controller's "bclk"), so expose HDMI
audio.

